\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Hi Stewart,\'a0\
Forgive me if this email is all over the\'a0place, I am just\'a0trying to get out as much information as possible before I leave town until Monday evening.\'a0\
\
I really like the way this website is coming together. I think\'a0if you are able to transcribe the\'a0student speeches from the\'a0school board meetings, that could help with the word cloud/sentiment\'a0data. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.google.com/document/d/10qpUE-TTXMbrffCUcDH5lCa7KhpvvNWidKe1w1zi-aY/edit?usp=sharing"}}{\fldrslt \cf4 \ul \ulc4 \strokec4 Link to doc}} of all school board meetings with student and parent commenters is listed.\'a0\
\
I also think it would be worthwhile to either reach out via email OR Public Records act the following people who lead the task force: Dr. Dave Wellington task force lead, Director of Communications Carri Campbell, and Dr. Craig Foster and request information about the work of the\'a0task force.\
\
In 2022-2023 the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nsd.org/get-involved/task-forces-committees/student-wellness-and-safety-task-force"}}{\fldrslt \cf4 \ul \ulc4 \strokec4 Student Safety and Wellness Task Force}} required more qualitative data to be included\'a0into their report. I was allowed to facilitate student focus groups at Bothell High School to fulfill this data request. BHS students led each focus group and typed up the\'a0notes. The topics ranged on all things\'a0safety, but only the\'a0SRO program. You can find the information in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hldaCCpp1q0POJqM_VVWYBU1-st3qlos?usp=drive_link"}}{\fldrslt \cf4 \ul \ulc4 \strokec4 this folder}} along with other notes that I took during this time period.\'a0\
\
My only feedback so far on the site is that I am unsure about the wording of the school board votes on the main page and think it may cause some confusion. Sandy Hayes voted YES to approve the amendment to the inter-local agreement, the other 4 voted NO to end the amendment thereby ending the program. Also, the petition is at over 4300+ signatures now, so that figure can be updated:\'a0{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.change.org/p/save-bothell-high-school-s-sro-program-with-officer-ware"}}{\fldrslt \cf4 \ul \ulc4 \strokec4 https://www.change.org/p/save-bothell-high-school-s-sro-program-with-officer-ware}}\'a0\
\
\'a0The Timeline is a great\'a0visual and at-a-glance, should we add all news media stories there?\'a0\
\
Students are also hosting {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.change.org/p/let-s-make-officer-ware-our-graduation-speaker?recruiter=384229316&recruited_by_id=f78c0b50-5b5b-11e5-8ea5-ff3d88e26670&utm_source=share_petition&utm_campaign=psf_promote_or_share&utm_term=starter_onboarding_share_personal&utm_medium=sms&share_id=cK6JTgbzTD"}}{\fldrslt \cf4 \ul \ulc4 \strokec4 another petition}} on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://change.org/"}}{\fldrslt \cf4 \ul \ulc4 \strokec4 change.org}} to have Officer Ware be the official\'a0commencement speaker for the c/o 2026. They emailed the district and administrators to uninvite the four board members\'a0who voted on the evening of the vote on May 11th.\'a0\
\
SRO WA State Law:\'a0{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.leg.wa.gov/rcw/default.aspx?cite=28A.320.124"}}{\fldrslt \cf4 \ul \ulc4 \strokec4 https://app.leg.wa.gov/rcw/default.aspx?cite=28A.320.124}}\
\
Each year the school board is required by WA state law to REVIEW the SRO contract via this house bill:\'a0{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://lawfilesext.leg.wa.gov/biennium/2021-22/Pdf/Bill%20Reports/House/1214-S.E%20HBR%20PL%2021.pdf"}}{\fldrslt \cf4 \ul \ulc4 \strokec4 https://lawfilesext.leg.wa.gov/biennium/2021-22/Pdf/Bill%20Reports/House/1214-S.E%20HBR%20PL%2021.pdf}}\
NO OTHER DISTRICT interprets this law the way NSD does. Every year we are tortured into rallying our\'a0people to support this before they vote and that is NOT normal. The survey should be enough. I need to connect with people at Everett SD and Lake WA SD and find out what their board does.\'a0\
\
Grant funding for SRO contract- We need evidence that it is truly grant funded.\'a0\
I found this, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.leg.wa.gov/rcw/default.aspx?cite=28A.300.650"}}{\fldrslt \cf4 \ul \ulc4 \strokec4 https://app.leg.wa.gov/rcw/default.aspx?cite=28A.300.650}}\
I still cannot find it anywhere in the NSD site though and have someone who was on the task force working on asking Carri Campbell.\'a0\
\
\
That is all I can come with for now, hope it helps!\'a0\
\
